# Fluid Fire RT Smoke Report - 2026-07-06

## Scope

- Minimal Unreal viability pass for a 2D texture-based fire/smoke simulation inspired by the Unity Ignitement breakdown.
- Uses RenderTarget ping-pong and material Custom HLSL only; no project C++ and no runtime UnrealMCP dependency.
- Quality pass targets the reference traits called out in the Unity article: broad 2D fluid motion, temperature-driven smoke, reaction-driven fire, and glow/light-map reuse.
- State RT RGB contract: density, temperature, reaction.
- Velocity RT RGB contract: encoded velocity XY and speed.
- Visual RT is a smoke/fire/glow colorization pass for inspection.

